# VoAIs Indic Calling Agent
Region: asia-south1 (Mumbai)

## Nodes
- A1: g2-standard-4, 1x NVIDIA L4 24GB, no public IP.
  Chalega: vLLM with Qwen3.6-35B-A3B AWQ 4-bit, port 8000,
  max-model-len 4096, gpu-memory-utilization 0.92, prefix caching ON.
- A2: n1-standard-4 + 1x T4 16GB, no public IP.
  Chalega: IndicConformer STT (port 8001), Magpie TTS (port 8002).
- B: e2-standard-4, public static IP.
  Chalega: Asterisk + Node orchestrator + VoAIs app.

## Network
Ek VPC, asia-south1. A1 aur A2 private only.
Sirf B unse baat karega, ports 8000-8002 pe.
